eck out the crash site with different game mode's for the game.", "short_description": "Liminality is a horror game involving Liminal Spaces and the Backrooms. Entity's appear infrequently, But the atmosphere brings up the intensity. In Liminality you get to choose where you want to start your adventure. Each decision has a different outcome. Try not to be caught. Do you think you can survive?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.termsfeed.com/live/454e05f9-e375-4355-96cb-7d868d4974f7", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Kindsty Studio's", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/baboonislands/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25539429799023828"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303746_861515269897019_2942768493083775201_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UIrG5Luck64Q7kNvwEOQGn9&_nc_oc=Adr9SC5mYOv_-eX5PnG9XpampKrYpWgzQZEfg1dyFWMeQcU3oOB3Gwz0YVo4ySWdKe8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1pxf_emhBFRwGV2M9gozAXY_zGPJJabXKQIWR13gBjIA&oe=69F20C2E"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Liminality", "platform": "ANDROID_